## Import

GA2 accelerate area can be imported using the composite id `<global_accelerator_id>#<accelerator_area_id>`, e.g.

```sh
$ pulumi import tencentcloud:Ga2/accelerateArea:AccelerateArea example ga-jg9gepn0#area-jrsub43y
```

tencentcloud:Ga2/endpointGroup:EndpointG.description:
Provides a resource to create a GA2 (Global Accelerator 2) endpoint group.

