> **NOTE:** You can launch an CVM instance for a VPC network via specifying parameter <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`vpcId`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`VpcId`" pulumi-lang-go="`vpcId`" pulumi-lang-python="`vpc_id`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`vpcId`" pulumi-lang-java="`vpcId`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`vpc_id`">`vpcId`</span>. One instance can only belong to one VPC.

> **NOTE:** At present, `PREPAID` instance cannot be deleted directly and must wait it to be outdated and released automatically.

> **NOTE:** Currently, the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`placementGroupId`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`PlacementGroupId`" pulumi-lang-go="`placementGroupId`" pulumi-lang-python="`placement_group_id`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`placementGroupId`" pulumi-lang-java="`placementGroupId`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`placement_group_id`">`placementGroupId`</span> field only supports setting and modification, but not deletion.

> **NOTE:** When creating a CVM instance using a <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`launchTemplateId`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`LaunchTemplateId`" pulumi-lang-go="`launchTemplateId`" pulumi-lang-python="`launch_template_id`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`launchTemplateId`" pulumi-lang-java="`launchTemplateId`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`launch_template_id`">`launchTemplateId`</span>, if you set other parameter values ​​at the same time, the template definition values ​​will be overwritten.

> **NOTE:** It is recommended to use resource <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`tencentcloud.Eip.Instance`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`tencentcloud.Eip.Instance`" pulumi-lang-go="`Eip.Instance`" pulumi-lang-python="`Eip.Instance`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`tencentcloud.Eip.Instance`" pulumi-lang-java="`tencentcloud.Eip.Instance`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`tencentcloud_eip`">`tencentcloud.Eip.Instance`</span> to create a AntiDDos Eip, and then call resource <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`tencentcloud.Eip.Association`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`tencentcloud.Eip.Association`" pulumi-lang-go="`Eip.Association`" pulumi-lang-python="`Eip.Association`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`tencentcloud.Eip.Association`" pulumi-lang-java="`tencentcloud.Eip.Association`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`tencentcloud_eip_association`">`tencentcloud.Eip.Association`</span> to bind it to resource <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`tencentcloud.Instance.Instance`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`tencentcloud.Instance.Instance`" pulumi-lang-go="`Instance.Instance`" pulumi-lang-python="`Instance.Instance`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`tencentcloud.Instance.Instance`" pulumi-lang-java="`tencentcloud.Instance.Instance`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`tencentcloud_instance`">`tencentcloud.Instance.Instance`</span>.

> **NOTE:** When creating a prepaid CVM instance and binding a data disk, you need to explicitly set <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`deleteWithInstance`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`DeleteWithInstance`" pulumi-lang-go="`deleteWithInstance`" pulumi-lang-python="`delete_with_instance`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`deleteWithInstance`" pulumi-lang-java="`deleteWithInstance`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`delete_with_instance`">`deleteWithInstance`</span> to <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`false`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`False`" pulumi-lang-go="`false`" pulumi-lang-python="`false`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`false`" pulumi-lang-java="`false`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`false`">`false`</span>.

> **NOTE:** When using dedicated resource pool packs, both <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`dedicatedResourcePackTenancy`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`DedicatedResourcePackTenancy`" pulumi-lang-go="`dedicatedResourcePackTenancy`" pulumi-lang-python="`dedicated_resource_pack_tenancy`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`dedicatedResourcePackTenancy`" pulumi-lang-java="`dedicatedResourcePackTenancy`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`dedicated_resource_pack_tenancy`">`dedicatedResourcePackTenancy`</span> and <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`dedicatedResourcePackIds`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`DedicatedResourcePackIds`" pulumi-lang-go="`dedicatedResourcePackIds`" pulumi-lang-python="`dedicated_resource_pack_ids`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`dedicatedResourcePackIds`" pulumi-lang-java="`dedicatedResourcePackIds`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`dedicated_resource_pack_ids`">`dedicatedResourcePackIds`</span> must be specified together. These parameters work with pre-purchased resource pool packs (resource <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`tencentcloudCvmResourcePoolPacks`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`TencentcloudCvmResourcePoolPacks`" pulumi-lang-go="`tencentcloudCvmResourcePoolPacks`" pulumi-lang-python="`tencentcloud_cvm_resource_pool_packs`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`tencentcloudCvmResourcePoolPacks`" pulumi-lang-java="`tencentcloudCvmResourcePoolPacks`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`tencentcloud_cvm_resource_pool_packs`">`tencentcloudCvmResourcePoolPacks`</span>).

## Example Usage

### Create a general POSTPAID_BY_HOUR CVM instance

<!--Start PulumiCodeChooser -->
```typescript
import * as pulumi from "@pulumi/pulumi";
import * as tencentcloud from "@tencentcloud_iac/pulumi";

const config = new pulumi.Config();
const availabilityZone = config.get("availabilityZone") || "ap-guangzhou-4";
const images = tencentcloud.images.getInstance({
    imageTypes: ["PUBLIC_IMAGE"],
    imageNameRegex: "OpenCloudOS Server",
});
const types = tencentcloud.instance.getTypes({
    filters: [{
        name: "instance-family",
        values: [
            "S1",
            "S2",
            "S3",
            "S4",
            "S5",
        ],
    }],
    cpuCoreCount: 2,
    excludeSoldOut: true,
});
// create vpc
const vpc = new tencentcloud.vpc.Instance("vpc", {
    cidrBlock: "10.0.0.0/16",
    name: "vpc",
});
// create subnet
const subnet = new tencentcloud.subnet.Instance("subnet", {
    vpcId: vpc.id,
    availabilityZone: availabilityZone,
    name: "subnet",
    cidrBlock: "10.0.1.0/24",
});
// create CVM instance
const example = new tencentcloud.instance.Instance("example", {
    instanceName: "tf-example",
    availabilityZone: availabilityZone,
    imageId: images.then(images => images.images?.[0]?.imageId),
    instanceType: types.then(types => types.instanceTypes?.[0]?.instanceType),
    systemDiskType: "CLOUD_PREMIUM",
    systemDiskSize: 50,
    kmsKeyId: "kms-xxxxxxxx",
    hostname: "user",
    projectId: 0,
    vpcId: vpc.id,
    subnetId: subnet.id,
    dataDisks: [{
        dataDiskType: "CLOUD_PREMIUM",
        dataDiskSize: 50,
        encrypt: false,
    }],
    tags: {
        tagKey: "tagValue",
    },
});
