Provide a resource to create a kubernetes cluster endpoint. This resource allows you to create an empty cluster first without any workers. Only all attached node depends create complete, cluster endpoint will finally be enabled.

> **NOTE:** Recommend using <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`dependsOn`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`DependsOn`" pulumi-lang-go="`dependsOn`" pulumi-lang-python="`depends_on`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`dependsOn`" pulumi-lang-java="`dependsOn`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`depends_on`">`dependsOn`</span> to make sure endpoint create after node pools or workers does.

