* <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`secretName`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`SecretName`" pulumi-lang-go="`secretName`" pulumi-lang-python="`secret_name`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`secretName`" pulumi-lang-java="`secretName`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`secret_name`">`secretName`</span> - (Required, ForceNew) Name of secret which cannot be repeated in the same region. The maximum length is 128 bytes. The name can only contain English letters, numbers, underscore and hyphen '-'. The first character must be a letter or number.
